    "id": "vic20",
    "name": {
      "zh": "Commodore VIC-20",
      "en": "Commodore VIC-20"
    },
    "intro": {
      "zh": "Commodore VIC-20 是 1980 年 Commodore 推出的低价家用电脑，以 6502 处理器、彩色图形与 299 美元的亲民价格，成为首台销量破百万的个人电脑。",
      "en": "The Commodore VIC-20, launched in 1980, was the first personal computer to sell one million units, thanks to its 6502 CPU, colour graphics and affordable price."
    },
    "spec_version": "0.2",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine_min_version": "0.1.0",
    "precision_level": "L2",
    "era": 1980,
    "manufacturer": "Commodore",
    "category": "personal-computer",
    "description": "Commodore VIC-20（1980），首台销量破百万的个人电脑：6502 CPU 1.02MHz、5KB 内存、VIC 彩色图形芯片、键盘主机一体、外置数据磁带机、接电视。",
    "authors": [
